            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Dizziness? (دوار, duwār.) An ointment? (مرهم, marham.) A surgeon? (جراح, jarrāḥ.) A crutch? (عكاز, ʿukkāz.) Bleeding? (نزيف, nazīf.) Since? (منذ, mundhu.) Dawn? (فجر, fajr.) Sunrise? (شروق, shurūq.) Sunset? (غروب, ghurūb.) Birth? (ميلاد, mīlād.) Yearly? (سنوي, sanawī.) Late morning? (ضحى, ḍuḥā.) Soon? (قريبا, qarīban.) An alarm clock? (منبه, munabbih.) A calendar? (تقويم, taqwīm.) A museum? (متحف, matḥaf.) A stadium? (ملعب, malʿab.) A pavement; a platform? (رصيف, raṣīf.) A crossroads? (تقاطع, taqāṭuʿ.) An embassy? (سفارة, sifāra.)"
